# ERCOT raw archives: 26 MB of zips that scripts/fetch_prices.py re-downloads on
# demand. The derived parquet next to them is the artefact worth versioning --
# it is a quarter the size and it is what every result was computed from.
data/prices/raw/

# Cube build checkpoint: 792 lines of intermediate cells. web/public/cube.json
# is the artefact worth versioning; this is how it survives a kill -9.
results/cube_cells.jsonl
